// # fs/os — Operating System Surface
//
// Logline: The OS syscall shims (sys_exec, sys_args, sys_prctl), the policy getenv filter (OODA_/OO_ keys only), the file I/O surface, the net-floor loopback constraint, the host process info, the rlimit setter, the time+rand source, and the Landlock-gated proc_mem.
//
// Beats:
//   1. sys.c — sys_exec, sys_args, policy getenv, child filter env.
//   2. fs.c — file I/O with cap-gated path safety.
//   3. netfloor.c — net-floor loopback constraint.
//   4. host.c — host process info (pid, ppid, etc.).
//   5. dns.c — the loopback-only resolver.
//   6. dns.h — the OoDNS resolver type.
//   7. rlimit.c — setrlimit wrapper.
//   8. rlimit.h — the OoRlimit type.
//   9. time_rand.c — monotonic time + secure random.
//
// ──▓▓ fs/os ANCHOR ──▓▓──
// :: fail-closed: no getaddrinfo, no unrestricted env ::
